cbE6H62lJKswgTQ0z7xELW7rkBYiKohedA&oe=6B0335D1"}, {"file_name": "MedLevelSelect.png", "id": "486155310766917", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75520122_486155314100250_6851802354829899748_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2uVyMX3hnbEQ7kNvwFjrJnC&_nc_oc=AdomScBNk9dfyUgnjpzg_v6eK34714-BPietvTwx3BoJC0_gL33cYZVWqFVOYE_oEpM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSgkVeTrmhMDCoouZbtScED7U3smyCyUUStO1CPSijlng&oe=6B0326F2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "ArcadeBG.png", "id": "3327318267576392", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75356794_3327318270909725_3314026119492980721_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=abvh_ejcqnEQ7kNvwE_XF14&_nc_oc=AdpgEMyPOmEhKuJoA5DaTHtFd8EXr4Ks0Ya9s_aoKmSAJUMvgQLJf4gpgipu-76WAN8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSwlaTlloI6BgTd6Lt2AmDR0na0iBXgR_H_D-uhTTtFhQ&oe=6B030EEC"}, "display_name": "On Point", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**On Point** is a shooter, filled with Warioware-style arcade minigames. Think, aim, and blast your way to a high score through endless shooting minigames, but don't hit those bombs or you'll run out of lives!\n\n## ABOUT\n- Compete in over 90 minigames.\n- Easy, medium, and hard mode.\n- Local, global, and friends leaderboards.\n- Tuned for all experience and comfort levels.\n\n## DESCRIPTION\n- Arcade-style target shooting minigames.\n- Newcomer mode, low intensity, to ease players into VR.\n- Hardcore mode, for experienced players to challenge themselves and the leaderboards.\n- Fully in-world experience.\n", "short_description": "On Point is a shooter, filled with Warioware-style arcade minigames. Think, aim, and blast your way to a high score through endless shooting minigames, but don't hit those bombs or you'll run out of lives!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_u